&lt;div class=&quot;image-container aligncenter&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/ebolen-text/century.JPG&quot; alt=&quot;century.JPG&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
