&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AKA 九岁，keep real. ——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3967806&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;ShineShadowD&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3967806)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd&quot;  &gt;ShineShadowD&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁，我来围观你的人事啦，为你点赞。――&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4423816&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;Dr_Naxurt&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4423816)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt&quot;  &gt;Dr_Naxurt&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁酱太强啦！等等，我是始作俑者吗？)那我写点别的……白切鸡天下第一！祝九岁快高长大不要老是停留在九岁(？——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;YUANNN&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn&quot;  &gt;YUANNN&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁酱太强啦！——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/purples0ul-ding&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2334417&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;PurpleS0ul_Ding&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2334417)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/purples0ul-ding&quot;  &gt;PurpleS0ul_Ding&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁酱太强啦！（——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662223&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;pokm&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662223)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm&quot;  &gt;pokm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁的文我已经卧槽了三个多月，再吹下去我怕是要升天了[灵魂出窍]。在我心中，优秀到极致的作品大概就是这样了。第一次觉得语文没学好是如此地难受，这一肚子的赞美都要溢出来了却没有能力表达出来真是憋屈感[捂脸]。情节紧凑，文笔俱佳，字字珠玑，步步为营，这种糅合且极致真的鲨我&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3290685&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;Rye Travis&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3290685)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis&quot;  &gt;Rye Travis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁酱太强啦！（——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-alucardsin&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4513786&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;Dr AlucardSin&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4513786)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-alucardsin&quot;  &gt;Dr AlucardSin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁酱太强啦！（括号给你删干净了，加钱）——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;Auroriaaaaa&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;Auroriaaaaa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Radio gaga~Radio gogo~——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;sciencekiller&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller&quot;  &gt;sciencekiller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;（愚人节特供）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;之前没敢在任何人的人事留言2333今天突发奇想……要我说呢科杀（啊，我习惯叫这个了）就是又硬核又细致（不好意思我词穷，反正强就是了）。继续向主站杰出作者看齐，加油！——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4020589&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;Just_We&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4020589)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we&quot;  &gt;Just_We&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;九岁酱太强啦！（人类的本质是——）&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;Frozen starry sky&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky&quot;  &gt;Frozen starry sky&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;科杀，妈咪应不应该在690-J那里塞上你，你他妈的是神，收容措施都是你写的呜呜咪（¿）&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacketjiong&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6151941&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607152424&quot; alt=&quot;JacKeTJioNG&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6151941)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacketjiong&quot;  &gt;JacKeTJioNG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
