					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="creditButtonStandalone"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>On your mark-Mark (oh hi <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RJ411q7VH">Mark</a>) get set!<br /> We're riding on the Internet!<br /> Cyberspace, <em>cyber5ex</em><br /> Interactive <em>a$$ site</em>, A window to the <em>webtight</em><br /> Searching for <sup>reality</sup>——<br /> Get online, <span class="ruby"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><em>GeTonLInE</em></span><span class="rt">AHHHHHHHHHHHH</span></span><br /> <strong>Take a spit on the <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18E411L7e6">internet</a>!</strong></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit" style="text-align:center; margin-top: 0.5em;"> <p><a href="#u-credit-otherwise">更多</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="u-credit-otherwise"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/3" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>更多</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit otherwise"> <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><em>This page is a mistake.</em></p> </blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;">sciencekiller's curiosity for learning has SKYROCKETED</p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="border: solid #E0C447 1px; padding: 1px;"> <div class="danke agent"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> SCiPNET内部服务器-011.[SCiPNET v5.0.11]</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> &lt;@_——————————————————————_@&gt;</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> &gt;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">欢迎使用SCiPNET内部服务器-011。请问您需要做什么？</span>&lt;</p> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> T:\&gt;cd listcheck</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> T:\listcheck\&gt;访问4级权限档案库</p> </blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> &gt;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">正在访问…已完成。</span>&lt;</p> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> T:\listcheck\&gt;搜索：*\职员人事\标题=science</p> </blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> &gt;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">搜索结果：sciencekiller的人事页</span>&lt;</p> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> T:\listcheck\&gt;查询：sciencekiller的人事页</p> </blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> &gt;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">已查找到文件-sciencekiller的人事页。</span>&lt;</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span> Now Loading&#8230;</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><span style="font-family:'yukarimobileregular';">Sciencekiller</span><span style="font-family:'华文中宋';">之人事，别管它是什么其他东西</span></span></h3> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:200%;"><span class="fa fa-spinner fa-pulse fa-spin" style="color: #482C68"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br /> <span style="font-family:'等线';">你瞧这个评分模块它&#8230;额。。。</span><br /></p> </div> <div class="ticker"> <p>最新施工项目： <a href="http://smlt.wikidot.com/sciencekiller:possible">SCP-CN-XXXX “所以我们得以留存在黑暗之后”</a></p> </div> <br /> <div id="wiki-tabview-e8cd5c7897f7b49a47c9465d8f950b84" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>员工档案</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>研究项目一览</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>随机东西</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>留言</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Hall of Fame</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>灵感</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/sciencekiller3/wow.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="wow.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span>登上神坛。</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/sciencekiller3/teaerrors.png" style="width:300px;" alt="teaerrors.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span>。</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>员工姓名：</strong>罗久明/Sanfranbrooks Lou</p> <p><strong>代号：</strong>sciencekiller/科学杀手/Luo/老久/塞力斯</p> <p><strong>员工等级：</strong>3~4</p> <p><strong>从事工作：</strong>分析学顾问，档案整理员，抽象异常学部员工，多元宇宙部员工。</p> <p><strong>描述：</strong>男，31岁，中国籍，体态中等偏胖<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-313127-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>。在2014年基金会于中国广东深圳的招募行动中以初级职员身份被招募，曾在ATF-Hartlepool-☏ “Foundational Bureau of Investigation”<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-313127-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>服役，目前在多元宇宙部工作。</p> <p>罗久明不好言谈和交际，厌恶社交媒体，除向站点高层提交报告和其他极少数时间外只在办公室内活动。按个人要求，罗久明的办公室内配备有加夫列尔·加西亚·马尔克斯的全部著作和咖啡机，除此之外，他被允许持有站点图书馆的永久门禁卡和借书权限。</p> <p>罗久明在多元宇宙部的工作中因工作效率、工作态度和参与的大量重要研究受到其他员工的称赞，但其本人对此不屑一顾。罗久明常把多元宇宙部的报告文件格式描述成“怪异到操蛋”。</p> <p>在业余时间中，罗久明爱好混音和创作电子音乐，对电子音乐文化和嘻哈文化表现出极大的爱好。曾多次在所属工作小组闲暇时表演打碟，但其他人并未对此表现出兴趣。<br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▶由其他员工整理的语录◀</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷哦，草了。我不知道这是怎么出来的◁</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: left;"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #444444; width: 400px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>无内鬼，来点群阳阳。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="float: right;">——罗久明于工作小组网上群聊时</span><br /> <span style="float: right;">Dr.阳齿轮记</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #444444; width: 400px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>你永远想不到，神圣的皮炎，GOC变成了魔法部。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="float: right;">——罗久明在着手研究<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/goc-supplemental-thaumatology">LAW84-03宇宙</a>基线信息时对此宇宙内GOC技术评价道</span><br /> <span style="float: right;">研究员京桦记</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #444444; width: 400px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>yoyo check 1&#160;2&#160;1&#160;2，现在是科杀on the mic，yoyoyo</p> <hr /> <p><span style="float: right;">——在小组休息时组员玩rap battle，Dr.Readeiier为罗久明写的预热词</span><br /> <span style="float: right;">这不是科杀的语录，但我还是要记下来。——Dr.Readeiier记</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #444444; width: 400px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>我们亲切地称它为现实扭曲。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="float: right;">——罗久明在研究LAW84-03宇宙内的GOC术语时如是说</span><br /> <span style="float: right;">Dr.Michealle记</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #444444; width: 400px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>你受到antimeme影响了吗？这么快就不认得我？</p> <hr /> <p><span style="float: right;">——罗久明在研究员Gusta和他打招呼时大惊小怪</span><br /> <span style="float: right;">研究员京桦记</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #444444; width: 400px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>这是你们应得的：每打扰一次科杀本杀就有&#8230;草，我编不下去了，没有买卖没有杀害。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="float: right;">——罗久明在研究员翔闲打扰他而把可乐泼洒时发脾气</span><br /> <span style="float: right;">特工Darwin X记</span><br /></p> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #444444; width: 400px; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>要是基金会能有那群修咖啡机的一半高效的话，我们早就能登神了。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="float: right;">——罗久明同其他人谈话时如是说</span><br /> <span style="float: right;">驻站ATF人员蒋志祥记</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /> <span style="font-size:x-small;">Don't touch that dial now</span> <p><span style="font-size:x-small;">告诉<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-story-of-my-life">李腾驰</a>我很抱歉</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:x-small;">我很</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▶需5级权限◀</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷授权成功◁</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: left;"> <div style="display: block ; border : dashed 1px #444444 ; background :#F5F5F5 ; margin-left : auto ; margin-right : auto ; width : auto ; padding:10px"> <p>多项后续研究证明，罗久明具备多种方面上的超过目前常态认知和基金会所掌握的知识，特别在于对超前科技的知识，且表现出不同寻常的知识接受和学习能力。罗久明表现出多种记忆异常，包括超忆症、出现不属于自己的记忆、间歇性失忆等，这些异常使其精神状态越发不稳定，并出现多种潜在的精神问题。目前罗久明同意接受基金会提出的缓解程序和治疗。</p> <p>多份从其他宇宙回收的资料称罗久明的实际年龄可能超过90岁，而他曾通过某种异常方式使身体年龄维持在现在水平。罗久明可能曾在多个平行宇宙中转，直到来到本宇宙，而他得到在多元宇宙部的工作职位的方法也未查明。</p> <p>根据<strong>[数据删]</strong>，罗久明的真正本质是部分超知识，其来源是对所处宇宙内基准信息的每一次成功感知。<strong>[数据</strong><br /> <br /></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:'Merriweather';">I AM.</span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:x-small;">又见面了。</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> …<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> …<br /> <span style="font-size:x-small;">真该死。</span><br /> <br /> …<br /> <span style="font-size:x-small;">你们以为靠那个“技术问题”就可以把我困在那里？</span><br /> <br /> …<br /> <span style="font-size:x-small;">不，或者<br /> 你们想要让我留在这</span><br /> …<br /> <span style="font-size:x-small;">把我当做工具？</span><br /> <br /> <strong>&#8230;</strong><br /> <span style="font-size:x-small;">那我又在担心什么呢？</span><br /> <strong>&#8230;</strong><br /> <strong>&#8230;</strong><br /> <span style="font-size:x-small;">到你们了，让我见见你们的科学。</span></p> </div> <br /> <span class="blinkbar">_</span></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷授权成功◁</a></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span>想看我的作品？找这里就对了！</span></h4> </div> <hr /> <div class="blbf-main"> <div class="blbf-unique-name-1 blbf-{$color-family}"> <div class="anom-bar-container item-CN-1790 clear-4 keter none keneq 危险 {$american} lang-cn"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item"><span class="lang-cn">项目编号：</span><span class="lang-tr">項目編號：</span></span><span class="number">CN-1790</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level"><span class="lang-cn">等级</span><span class="lang-tr">等級</span>4</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">收容等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">收容等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">keter</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">次要等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">次要等級：</span></div> <div class="class-tex