 黑光</strong></span></p> <hr /> <p>——神没有目的。</p> <p style="text-align: center;">与<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4516971&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Rachud" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4516971)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" >Rachud</a></span>共同翻译</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/sciencekiller3/mememe.png" style="width:300px;" alt="mememe.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>感谢<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="YUANNN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" >YUANNN</a></span>画的我！</p> </div> </div> <p>哦，你好，我想你一定撑过了前面的垃圾板式，尴尬笑话、不明展开和瞎眼代码。现在请坐下休息一会，其他自便。</p> <p>我是<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span>，或者九岁<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-313127-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup>/科杀，一名kaktus gang，ACS和黑色标记笔的大力推行者，谜团风、meta和抽象风（<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="MaliceAforethought" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" >MaliceAforethought</a></span>那样的）爱好者，比较喜欢意识流、美式硬派黑色侦探小说和拉美超现实主义小说。</p> <p>有时候会开大，但更多时候可能会像Malice那样有些意识流风和抽象的谜团系小短文（我这垃圾组词），而且估计只写SCP。我不会写奇术，要写也得靠平行宇宙。我主要是像写严肃系带点硬派幽默风格（实际上第二点我不知道怎么写）的作品。</p> <p>18年入坑，19年正式登上wiki。来基金会就是看上了那股神秘系风格和一些带点超现实主义色彩的meta文档（大概？）</p> <p>现实生活中还喜欢电音、马尔克斯、YouTuber解说<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-313127-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >4</a></sup>、我的世界等等东西。</p> <p>总之，我是个按兴趣行事的人。</p> <p>要问我喜欢的主站作者？<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" >Rounderhouse</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="MaliceAforethought" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" >MaliceAforethought</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img cl