lass="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:5px; margin:0.1em; float:left; background:var(--gradient-header)"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/sciencekiller3/ATF1.png" alt="ATF1.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption"> <p style="text-align: center;">ATF-Hartlepool-☏标志</p> <p style="text-align: center;">由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span>制作</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:5px; margin:0.1em; float:left; background:var(--gradient-header)"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/sciencekiller3/ATF2.png" alt="ATF2.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption"> <p style="text-align: center;">另一个ATF-Hartlepool-☏标志</p> <p style="text-align: center;">由<span class="error-inline"><em>Resazurin</em> 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名</span>制作</p> </div> </div> <div style="width:100%;clear: both;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div style="border: 1px solid black; display: inline-block; width: 50%"><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/sciencekiller3/red.png" style="margin: 0px" alt="red.png" class="image" /><br /></div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;">SCP-CN-1689</p> <p style="text-align: center;">由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/night-raven" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5400957&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Night Raven" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5400957)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/night-raven" >Night Raven</a></span>所作</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div style="border: 1px solid black; display: inline-block; width: 50%"><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/sciencekiller3/eel.png" style="margin: 0px" alt="eel.png" class="image" /><br /></div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;">SCP-CN-1832</p> <p style="text-align: center;">由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/night-raven" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5400957&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Night Raven" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5400957)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/night-raven" >Night Raven</a></span>所作</p> <div style="width:100%;clear: both;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <blockquote> <p>AKA 九岁，keep real. ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3967806&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="ShineShadowD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3967806)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd" >ShineShadowD</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁，我来围观你的人事啦，为你点赞。――<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4423816&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Dr_Naxurt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4423816)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" >Dr_Naxurt</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁酱太强啦！等等，我是始作俑者吗？)那我写点别的……白切鸡天下第一！祝九岁快高长大不要老是停留在九岁(？——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="YUANNN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" >YUANNN</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁酱太强啦！——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/purples0ul-ding" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2334417&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="PurpleS0ul_Ding" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2334417)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/purples0ul-ding" >PurpleS0ul_Ding</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁酱太强啦！（——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662223&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="pokm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662223)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm" >pokm</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁的文我已经卧槽了三个多月，再吹下去我怕是要升天了[灵魂出窍]。在我心中，优秀到极致的作品大概就是这样了。第一次觉得语文没学好是如此地难受，这一肚子的赞美都要溢出来了却没有能力表达出来真是憋屈感[捂脸]。情节紧凑，文笔俱佳，字字珠玑，步步为营，这种糅合且极致真的鲨我&#8230;&#8230;——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3290685&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Rye Travis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3290685)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" >Rye Travis</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁酱太强啦！（——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-alucardsin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4513786&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Dr AlucardSin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4513786)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-alucardsin" >Dr AlucardSin</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁酱太强啦！（括号给你删干净了，加钱）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Auroriaaaaa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" >Auroriaaaaa</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Radio gaga~Radio gogo~——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span>（愚人节特供）</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>之前没敢在任何人的人事留言2333今天突发奇想……要我说呢科杀（啊，我习惯叫这个了）就是又硬核又细致（不好意思我词穷，反正强就是了）。继续向主站杰出作者看齐，加油！——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4020589&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Just_We" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4020589)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we" >Just_We</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>九岁酱太强啦！（人类的本质是——）<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="Frozen starry sky" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" >Frozen starry sky</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>科杀，妈咪应不应该在690-J那里塞上你，你他妈的是神，收容措施都是你写的呜呜咪（¿）<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacketjiong" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6151941&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="JacKeTJioNG" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6151941)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacketjiong" >JacKeTJioNG</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:5px; margin:0.1em; float:left; background:var(--gradient-header)"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragment%3Aylumwlne-1/12.png" alt="12.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption"> <p style="text-align: center;">画廊大赛奖项</p> <p style="text-align: center;">内脏锅</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:5px; margin:0.1em; float:left; background:var(--gradient-header)"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragment%3Aylumwlne-1/14.png" alt="14.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption"> <p style="text-align: center;">画廊大赛奖项</p> <p style="text-align: center;">魅影重现</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:5px; margin:0.1em; float:left; background:var(--gradient-header)"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragment%3Aylumwlne-1/c6.png" alt="c6.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption"> <p style="text-align: center;">画廊大赛奖项</p> <p style="text-align: center;">[数据损坏]</p> </div> </div> <div style="width:100%;clear: both;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <hr /> <p><em>我只写SCP</em>。<br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCP-CN-XXXX “Tamlin死的第X次”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>这不是悖论。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCP-CN-EEEE “你的全部历史”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>针对记忆分配异常的<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/amnesticization">解决方案</a>。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCP-CN-FFFF “强加之担”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>我看到我们的船搁浅在它自己的滩涂上。我无法确定它损坏了多少，在月黑之时，舱内的惊惧和后知与哀嚎一同垂死，杏仁核中的罗盘轮廓从未停止轰响。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCP-CN-AAAA “过时警报广播”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>文档本身带有基金会JavaScript逻辑加密格式，但在加载完成后格式已被破坏。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCP-CN-𝚕0000 ——偶发部特典：《在全球技术型元叙述写作团队夺控情景发生时如何存活》，不我说的不是这个，有这东西也没用，反正这情景已经发生了。还有你绝对想不到能拿这东西连上超形上学部邮箱，而且他们真有。超长标题上线。</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p><em>竞标请求</em></p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCP-CN-SSSS “我管这叫垃圾帖”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p><em>占位</em></p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCP-CN-WWWW “仇家先生”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>你好，基金会。我们有事要解决。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">sciencekiller的提案——首级</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>SCP-CN-<span style="color: red"><strong>001</strong></span>的本质即是<span style="color: red"><strong>最先级</strong></span>。</p> </blockquote> <hr /> <h4><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">一些MTF名字</span></strong></span></h4> <blockquote> <p>MTF-Xi-23 “ℒ”</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>MTF-Upsilon-51 “Vau”</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>MTF-Lambda-102 “重水加量”</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>MTF-Hephaistos-01 “Annus Mirabilis”</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>MTF-Convall-9“我等可处于光明之中”</p> </blockquote> <h4><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">ATF相关</span></strong></span></h4> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">ATF-Hartlepool-☏ “Foundational Bureau of Investigation”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>不仅是犯罪现场调查。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">MTF-Tau-35 “胡佛”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>这便是新世纪的安保。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">MTF-Sigma-34 “资源计划处”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>所有条件都有价可寻。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">MTF-Kappa-Gamma “格洛克19M”</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>闲话结束，所有人准备火力覆盖。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">MTF-Lota-[已编辑]</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p>不过是另外一种公务。</p> </blockquote> </div> <hr /></div> </div> </div> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-313127-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 他在健身了在健身了</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-313127-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. ATF-Hartlepool-☏ 为一基金会法务部指定的安保和执法类应用特遣队，主要负责监控安保、应对紧急事故并进行收尾工作、进行救援任务、管制收容项目、对特定目标进行监视，以及在各个国际、联邦和地区法律部门机构中安插潜伏作业人员，将机构行动中出现的目标物品、超常事件、特别关注人员和特别关注组织的关联事件报告至基金会以进行调查。 <p>该ATF核心力量由三个MTF组成：</p> <ul> <li>MTF-Tau-35 “胡佛”</li> <li>MTF-Sigma-34 “资源计划处”</li> <li>MTF-Kappa-Gamma “格洛克19M”</li> <li><span class="dblock">MTF-Lota-[已编辑] “公务系的皮条客”</span></li> </ul> <p>同时ATF收编了部分基金会MTF力量，包括MTF Gamma-5 “红鲱鱼”，MTF-Delta-5 “前线奔跑者”，MTF-Epsilon-11 “九尾狐”，MTF-Iota-10 “该死的联邦探员”等。</p> </div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-313127-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. 是的，我是九岁大军。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-313127-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. 不包括vtuber。</div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607152427" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span></p> 
